  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Observation contract",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Read-only developer observation. Every panel exposes its own source revision; separate queries may capture different revisions. **Check query errors and the last observation time before using retained values.** No data means no matching recorded rows; request errors mean unavailable data. Terminal results are events, not current expert states. Model-call success, composer adoption, answered requests and mailbox sending remain UNKNOWN. Positive historic scores without recorded eligibility remain UNKNOWN. Graph coverage/excerpt edges are declarations, not semantic proof. Reasons are redacted unless diagnostics is explicitly enabled."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
