      "type": "state-timeline",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "Execution start/finish prove RUNNING intervals; adjacent immutable snapshots prove PENDING intervals. Open running work, cancellation and zero-duration executions are not given invented end times. Terminal results appear below. Each agent is a separate frame/row. Revision is available in Query inspector response and the expert table; separate queries are not atomic. Conflicting pending/execution bounds are shown as OVERLAPPING_RECORDS; interval boundaries are split without inventing event times.",
